o Rebirth\n- Auto Race\n- Auto Buy\n- Auto Spin Wheel\n- Auto Claim Codes\n- Teleport Features\n- Everything you need to speed past the competition\n\n---\n\n## 🥷 Ninja Legends\n\nPacked with tools to help you rise through the ranks faster:\n\n- Auto Swing\n- Auto Sell\n- Auto Sell When Full\n- Auto Farm Chi\n- Auto Farm Coins\n- Auto Buy Swords\n- Auto Buy Belts\n- Auto Buy Skills\n- Auto Buy Shurikens\n- Auto Rank Up\n- Auto Teleports\n- Auto Buy Pets\n- Auto Evolve Pets\n- Auto Get Elements\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 Why NW Hub?\n\nNW Hub is made to feel simple, fast, and useful from the moment you open it.  \nWhether you’re rebirthing, farming, ranking up, or collecting everything in sight, NW Hub gives you the tools to do it cleaner and faster.\n\n**NW Hub — built to grind smarter.**","tags":["Keyless","Multigame","Mobile Friendly","Auto Farm","Auto Rebirth"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ceedif/Nw_Hub/refs/heads/main/Bootloader/main_loader\"))()","owner":{"_id":"678ea6919c7bd8961a216bf6","username":"Ceedif","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/678ea6919c7bd8961a216bf6-1737402273730.jpg","status":"offline","id":"678ea6919c7bd8961a216bf6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/8mXyDBsABM","views":5484,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isHub":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/0-1783090056767.png","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-07-03T14:47:36.796Z","executes":20395,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":18071,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:00.006Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"supportedGames":[{"_id":"68581d426160c666561c8a66","gameId":3177173279,"placeId":3177173279,"name":"Legends Of Speed","imageUrl":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c9f0f9a2bd565bfa66a6ff1a96ebdf1c/480/270/Image/Png/noFilter"},{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d99","gameId":3623096087,"placeId":3623096087,"na